    "summary": "The Police's restless engine. Fused punk energy with reggae space, put the hi-hat at the centre of the groove, and decorated everything with splashes, octobans and ride-bell backbeats. Plays traditional grip, grew up speaking Arabic in Beirut and Cairo, and later became a prolific film and concert composer."
